{{Documentation}}
This template is used to display information about an Uber set in [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats]].

==Parameters==
<pre>
{{GachaBanner|Set Name|bnr = |color = |text = |units =
Unit1
Unit2
Unit3
...
}}
</pre>

The first parameter is unnamed and takes the name of the Uber set. The full name must be entered exactly as it is done in the title of the page for the set.

<code>bnr</code> is an ID for the image of the banner. The banner images are in the format <code>Gatya bnr<ID>.png</code>. For Event Gacha, use <code>event</code> instead with an ID in the format <code>Gatya e bnr<ID>.png</code>. If the image name does not match the aforementioned patterns, use <code>image</code> while passing the full file name.

<code>color</code> specifies the color of the background of the template as raw CSS. It can be a linear gradient, a hexadecimal color code or an rgb triple. No colon or semicolon is necessary.

<code>text</code> is an optional parameter used when the units section is supposed to have plain text rather than the unit images. Some text needs to be passed as an argument for it to work. When this is on, the argument passed to <code>units</code> is directly used as the text.

<code>units</code> lists the Ubers in the set by First Form name. They are to be put on a line after <code>|units =</code> searated by newlines. If the set has a PC exclusive Uber, put it last.

==Usage==
<tabber>
Normal Banner=
<pre>
{{GachaBanner|The Dynamites|bnr = 741|color = linear-gradient(#FFFB4A, #CE0203)|units = 
Ice Cat
Cat Machine
Lesser Demon Cat
Marauder Cat
Baby Cat
Nurse Cat
Cat Clan Heroes
Lasvoss
Summoner Satoru
Cat Tengu
Cat Maid
}}
</pre>
===Result===
{{GachaBanner|The Dynamites|bnr = 741|color = linear-gradient(#FFFB4A, #CE0203)|units = 
