<pre>
{{GachaBanner|Platinum Capsules|bnr = 174|color = linear-gradient(#DDAFE1, #ACDCD1, #ACDCD1, #E5EAC2)|text = on|units = 
The player needs to use Platinum Tickets to enter this event. Platinum Tickets can be bought with real money during short time periods. Each Platinum Ticket guarantees an Uber Rare Cat from the Regular Pools.
}}
</pre>
